  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4221428,
    "UIName": "Hellion",
    "Id": "chassisdef_hellion_HEN-E",
    "Name": "Hellion",
    "Details": "The Hellion is a product of Clan Ice Hellion and their philosophy that espouses speed above all else. Based on the Mist Lynx, the Hellion is a fast OmniMech that has respectable firepower. This light 'Mech is rather difficult to kill, incorporating five and a half tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor. To save weight, the Hellion also uses an Endo Steel chassis. While it is not especially fast for its size, the Hellion does use MASC to allow for bursts of additional speed. The Hellion sports no fixed weapons on its chassis. The E configuration carries four Flamers, two AP Gauss Rifles, and for heavier enemies it carries a pair of Heavy Medium Lasers and an SRM-4 launcher. An ECM Suite is mounted in the head. It also has enough jump jets to cover 150 meters in a jump.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_hellion"
  },
